  "derivation": [
    "Two CanonicalGate constructors in PublicNativeService.prepare each validate empty prefix and issue one encode/TOKENIZE.",
    "Each successful committed token: admit.validate one TOKENIZE; take.validate one TOKENIZE; selected token _inspect one TOKENIZE.",
