    "Each receiver does one additional fullwire codec.encode; no sender prompt tokenization because public prompt IDs frozen.",
    "One Endpoint.begin/PROMPT and one observe/STEP plus distribution/DIST for every fully committed token; no uncommitted suffix or error exists in audited12 endpoints."
  ],
